	(text "THIRD BATTERY-SIDE CAPACITOR (review 2026-11-06): TI wants the output LC to resonate at 12-17 kHz (SLUS892D 10.2.1.2.6, 6.8 uH + 20 uF at 4 A). Two 10 uF 50 V X7R 1210 keep only ~6-7 uF each at 16 V (DC bias), ~17 kHz, at the edge; three give ~14 kHz. Last in the list so no other reference changes"
